        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "■/■/■"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I have an amazing sister, seriously! She's super smart and hardworking, and everybody loves her."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "But she never seems to be happy..."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I want her to be happy, but why didn't she like playing with me?"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "(A number of pages are skipped.)"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "■/■/■"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Today is our birthday, but I'm totally not feeling it."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Everyone prepared presents for us. I even got a huge doll for my sister! It cost me half a month's pocket money!"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "But she straight up forgot about my gift... Is she not fond of me or something?"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "(A number of pages are skipped.)"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "■/■/■"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Ugh, she's so annoying! She's always giving me lectures, but she was born just half a minute before me. Why always that attitude?"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "She's always telling me what I can and can't do, and she acts like it's for my own good. But deep down, she's just jealous that I don't have to bust my butt to get everyone's love!"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "She's always putting up a front, ugh! It's just so gross!"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "But whatever. I'm gonna do all the things she doesn't allow, and I'll make that witch super mad!"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "(A number of pages are skipped.)"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "■/■/■"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Oh no, a disaster! I accidentally broke that witch's violin..."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "And now she's gonna be all up in my ear. I already know what she's gonna say..."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"You should know better at your age!\", \"Having a sister like you is such a shame!\", \"I don't wanna see your face ever again!\" ... I've heard it all a million times over the years."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I'm so done with it. It's just a stupid violin anyway. I'll get her a new one or something."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Ahhh, my poor little piggy bank, back to being empty again..."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "(A number of pages are skipped.)"
              }
